WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:43.790
Stop taking so long!

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:54.510
Just you watch, kid! I'll kill you! I can't stand being made a fool of!

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:51.890
Is that...?

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:57.900
What's wrong, Yuji?

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:07.680
Yuji!

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:16.490
Hold up, we don't need any hazardous greetings, either one of us.

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:25.070
Are you guys with that group that was here yesterday!?

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:29.730
Are you still hanging around? Get the hell out of here, now!

00:03:29.840 --> 00:03:32.830
Just perfect. We're looking for someone.

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:38.340
A crazy-ass friend of ours got lost in the desert. Know anything about him?

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:40.680
His name is Yuji.

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:41.910
Yuji, you say?

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:44.020
You know of him?

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:46.020
Don't you move!

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:47.390
Wait!

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.360
These two are friends of mine. They aren't enemies!

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:57.030
Friends?

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:59.040
Yuji!

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:02.040
It's great you're still alive, you!

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:04.700
I'm glad you're all right too, Dice!

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:08.040
You sure are a tough bastard, no doubt about it!

00:04:08.110 --> 00:04:10.710
Not as tough as you are, Dice!

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:11.940
I suppose you're right!

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:16.380
Are you unharmed?

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.920
Ah, you too, Marlene!

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:21.720
Yuji...

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:22.550
Elena...

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:28.830
Who are these people?

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:54.360
We're quite a bit behind schedule, but we should still be able to make it there in time.

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:58.360
From here, I figure we've gotten to within about three days of Baikonur.

00:04:58.430 --> 00:05:05.030
We have to drive the Buggy day and night, but that can't be helped.

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.040
Let's go, Yuji!

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:09.730
I'm... not going.

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:17.040
I won't be going to Baikonur.

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:21.050
What are you saying? Why do you think we've come all this way!?

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:23.710
It was your duty, right?

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:28.050
Or could it have been to cure this illness that we don't even know is curable?

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:31.300
Or to check out the hell this world has become with my own eyes?

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:40.770
I've had quite enough... of that bitterness!

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:53.350
I'm... going to live here.

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:57.020
Like an ordinary person.

00:05:57.090 --> 00:06:01.680
Yuji!

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:08.030
Are you hungry? If we don't hurry back, our breakfast will be all gone!

00:06:08.100 --> 00:06:13.440
Y- yeah... right!

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:30.990
My...

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:38.960
My duty is to bring the Sleeper to Second Earth. And so...

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:48.330
You will follow me, even if I have to force you to!

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:50.340
Shoot away!

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:54.670
Why not shoot away, hitting me as well?

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:56.680
Elena!

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.680
lf...

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:02.690
...that's what it takes for you to be satisfied...

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.690
Stop it, Elena!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:53.170
My my, backing down that easily?

00:07:56.070 --> 00:07:58.600
Isn't that kind-hearted of you?

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:23.700
Hurry, we're leaving before noon!

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:36.300
No matter what, then?

00:08:36.380 --> 00:08:42.010
Yes. Yuji is just like us, you know. So I...

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:50.220
It all depends on him.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:12.680
Look, there's still some fuel left, isn't there? What a waste.

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:18.050
Yes, yes, I will see to you as well!

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:28.360
You're sure settling right in, ain't you?

00:09:28.470 --> 00:09:32.330
Surprisingly enough, this way may just suit you best after all, huh?

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:36.640
Yeah. It's only been a short while, but thanks for everything, Dice.

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:42.300
No need to thank me. I did it for the fun of it. But you know...

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:45.350
Aren't you overdoing it?

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:51.820
This is the life you've chosen for yourself. I've got no business telling you what to do.

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:55.990
Sorry, sorry!

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:59.330
Later, Yuji!

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:01.130
Don't go dying.

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:06.030
Dice...

00:10:43.710 --> 00:10:44.970
What a pretty sky!

00:10:46.380 --> 00:10:50.310
Yuji, the ocean you know of, is it as blue as this?

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:51.410
Y- yeah...

00:10:56.050 --> 00:11:00.990
Some day let's go see the ocean together, okay?

00:11:01.060 --> 00:11:01.790
Yeah...

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:17.910
This is good. I'm going to go on living, here...

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:48.740
He's gone, huh?

00:11:51.780 --> 00:11:55.040
Even so, something about it felt good.

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:57.380
Yuji and that girl.

00:11:57.450 --> 00:12:00.280
To think that it would come to me saying this!

00:12:00.350 --> 00:12:04.720
Well, that's what makes life interesting, I guess.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.750
I don't know, maybe I figured it wrong.

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:15.730
I was sure it was going to be you who would make Yuji into a man, you know.

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:22.730
The only thing you're working is your mouth. Are we ready to get underway!?

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:26.640
We're okay here. We're just waiting for you, ma'am.

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:42.780
Son of a...

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:50.330
- What?
- What was that!?

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:55.170
What is that?

00:12:57.780 --> 00:13:01.370
Don't tell me...!

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:04.940
Marlene and Dice! Are they being attacked by Blue!?

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.420
Dammit! It's too fast!

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:18.320
Yuji...

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.570
It's no good! This is having no effect!

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:44.680
Well, we're off!

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:49.350
There's no time to rest! We have to put some distance between us while we can!

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:05.840
Yuji...

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:16.390
You can't...

00:14:16.450 --> 00:15:30.950
Yuji!

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:47.670
That was a direct hit! But it was our last shot!

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:50.140
We can't kill it with just the two of us!

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.480
You're such a pest!

00:16:18.110 --> 00:16:20.040
Damn! Have we had it?

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:27.640
- What!?
- It's gone under again!

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:34.760
Where is it?

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.100
We're surrounded!

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:15.100
So, he's come!

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:35.040
Come on! Over here!

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:45.660
What's he doing!?

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:47.320
He couldn't be...!

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:47.480
Hmph, that was damn reckless!

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:14.010
Goodbye, Yuji...

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:07.230
Well, we've arrived at Baikonur Space Base. Thanks for putting up with the long journey.

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:13.670
Wonder... if we'll see the ocean...

00:20:13.740 --> 00:20:18.340
No reason I should be able to see it... in a place like this...

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:19.350
You can see it.

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:22.450
Of course you can.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:26.010
Once we go up into space, you can look at all the ocean you want.

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:32.620
W- what's so funny!?

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:35.290
Nothing, nothing at all.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:38.930
Yeah, we will see it, huh?

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:43.300
Once we go into space from there.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:49.310
Shall we go?

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:50.570
Yeah.

00:20:58.720 --> 00:21:01.020
See you around, kids.

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:40.540
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:46.670
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:55.820
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:55.940 --> 00:22:01.990
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:02.140 --> 00:22:08.410
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:08.770 --> 00:22:15.600
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:15.790 --> 00:22:20.760
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:26.820
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:27.120 --> 00:22:33.100
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:33.710 --> 00:22:40.580
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:40.760 --> 00:22:47.440
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:51.820 --> 00:22:53.440
A decoy mission?

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:57.440
Even if it is to allow the shuttle to launch, that's outrageous!

00:22:57.510 --> 00:22:59.770
The Blue won't be the only enemy!

00:22:59.840 --> 00:23:02.440
However, it is my duty.

00:23:02.510 --> 00:23:07.580
Yuji, no matter what happens to me, I'm going to get you into space.

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:09.450
That's right, no matter what.

00:23:09.520 --> 00:23:13.680
Marlene, don't die! Don't die, no matter what, Marlene!
